{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo contains a very small map that runs a single rescue mission.\u00a0 You can rescue up to four people from the nephilim giants.\u00a0 Depending on how well you do in the mission, you get four of the magic sigils of creation as you rescue people, and a random choice between two other letters.\u00a0 Thus, the demo allows collecting up to 6 out of the 22 sigils.\u00a0 There is also a small pond with fish to test out the swimming mechanics.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3682870?t=1748018262","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682870/9f524c652f79b5f0683276af53b34f399df977bf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748018262","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682870/a3621a8efd03f879f99b7f0aa2251e631cd730eb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748018262","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682870/a3621a8efd03f879f99b7f0aa2251e631cd730eb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748018262","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"The nephilim giants are savage and bloodthirsty.  They walk around in the nude, and all violence/gore in the demo centers around them."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo contains a very small map that runs a single rescue mission.\u00a0 You can rescue up to four people from the nephilim giants.\u00a0 Depending on how well you do in the mission, you get four of the magic sigils of creation as you rescue people, and a random choice between two other letters.\u00a0 Thus, the demo allows collecting up to 6 out of the 22 sigils.\u00a0 There is also a small pond with fish to test out the swimming mechanics.</p>","developers":["Terumah Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3094760","name":"Antediluvian: Seed in Peril"},"genres":[{"description